## 11. Adding a New Service Pack (Checklist)

1. Run `munray svc bootstrap <service> --svc-dir <SVC_DIR>`.
2. Replace the generated placeholders and implement one small read-only operation end-to-end.
3. Configure the generated read-only integration test and add guarded mutation coverage only when a safe fixture is available.
4. Run `munray validate --svc-dir <SVC_DIR>`.
5. Run `munray test --svc-dir <SVC_DIR>`.

